  "description": "Sometimes you just want to do something fun for the sake of doing something fun. We’re always tinkering with something at Esker HQ, and the Solitaire was born from the desire to keep things simple and a little nostalgic - a “throw-back”, if you will.\n\nThe Solitaire was designed to reduce complexities and encourage riders to go back to their roots. We removed unnecessary cable guides, condensing size options, and paired it with our new Fork Yeah! steel fork…it really ties the room together.\n\nOnly 50 of these framesets exist — the Solitaire is a project we’ve been dreaming about for a long while… finally made real.",
